SUMMARY:Food Bank & Christmas Lights Run
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Robyn Hall\n\n4 miles in about 45/50 minutes \nMeeting 
 at Victoria Park main car park. \nWe'll hunt down a few good lights display
 s too. \n\nThis is a run to support the Malvern food bank at what is always
  a difficult time of year. \nI'd love it if people could bring an item that
  I will take up to the Lyttleton well for them to distribute. \nI will add 
 the current shortages/requests as a discussion post but please feel free to
  bring anything you may already have that isn't on the list. They will be g
 rateful for all. \n\nSome of the Malvern light displays have collection tin
 s so please bring a little cash if you'd like to donate to them too. \n\nTo
 rches and visible clothing required. \nChristmas attire optional 🎄\n\nLi
 rf: Robyn [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com
 /clubs/208705/group_events/3429912367924567150\n\nSynced from Strava Club 2
 08705 on Sat\, 6 Dec @ 10:33 AM
